Please visit Services > Squid Proxy Server to configure and enable the proxy.

This package conflicts with pfSense-pkg-squid because both packages own the
same GUI and configuration files. Remove pfSense-pkg-squid before installing
the Kontrol package; the shared squid runtime will be reused when compatible.

The legacy Samba/NTLM Kontrol-ID helper and domain-join pages have been
retired. Transparent Windows identification is now managed by the separate
Kontrol-pkg-Kontrol-ID package under Services > Kontrol-ID.
